              "text": "The future master plan mandates a radical restructuring, particularly within the western sector. The existing library footprint will be entirely repurposed to accommodate a modern IT center, necessitating the construction of a new, centralized library facility that will directly straddle the main footpath. Concurrently, the car park will be completely eradicated to facilitate the erection of high-density student housing. On the eastern flank, the science block is earmarked for a major structural extension to significantly augment its capacity, leaving the student union as the only edifice untouched by the redevelopment.",
